      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: How to use",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 image editing with the prompt enhancer\n\n1. Connect the images to **both** the Prompt Enhancer and **Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1**, in the same order. Refer to them in your instruction as `<image1>`, `<image2>`, ...\n2. The enhancer rewrites the instruction into a precise edit prompt.\n\nExample images from ComfyUI's official template: [portrait_model_denim.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/portrait_model_denim.png), [clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png)\n\n**Models** (from [Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1)):\n- `diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n\nThe prompt enhancer downloads itself on first run (9.5 GB)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen-Image 2.1 image editing with the prompt enhancer\n\n1. Connect the images to **both** the Prompt Enhancer and **Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1**, in the same order. Refer to them in your instruction as `<image1>`, `<image2>`, ...\n2. The enhancer rewrites the instruction into a precise edit prompt.\n\nExample images from ComfyUI's official template: [portrait_model_denim.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/portrait_model_denim.png), [clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png)\n\n**Models** (from [Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1)):\n- `diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n\nThe prompt enhancer downloads itself on first run (9.5 GB)."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
